WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.625
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:01.118 --> 00:00:02.910
 Whether you're young,
whether you're old,

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:04.327
age is literally
just a number.

00:00:04.327 --> 00:00:07.110
What's important is making
sure to move and move well.

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:11.370
All I need you to do is follow
me and believe in yourself.

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:13.350
I was a college football player.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:14.400
I had an injury.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.800
I hurt my ankle really bad.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.540
I had depression.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:21.382
I needed to fix my body
and my emotional state if I

00:00:21.382 --> 00:00:22.590
was going to physically heal.

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:30.950
I realized my work was going to
be working on myself and seeing

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:33.540
how I could then
impact other people.

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:35.660
My personal fitness
and wellness philosophy

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:36.980
is called The Ocho System.

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:39.740
It focuses on putting physical
health first and then seeing

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:42.560
how that applies to other
areas of personal wellness

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:44.420
to produce best results.

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:46.980
It's flexible, and it can
meet you where you are.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.560
So you want to do
the bare minimum

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:51.020
to be effective to really
expedite your goals.

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:53.608
Let's just be better
consistently every day.

00:00:53.608 --> 00:00:55.955
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:57.330
In this MasterClass,
you're going

00:00:57.330 --> 00:01:00.362
to be an active participant
in your wellness practices.

00:01:00.362 --> 00:01:02.070
So I'm going to teach
you about nutrition

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:05.519
and then, also, how to
actually create your workouts.

00:01:05.519 --> 00:01:06.030
Let's go.

00:01:09.208 --> 00:01:10.500
So I know what you're thinking.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.810
I try to flex my bicep.

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:12.720
I don't see anything.

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:14.928
Well, that doesn't mean you
don't have muscles, okay?

00:01:14.928 --> 00:01:16.110
Everybody has muscle.

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:18.720
I hope you get a little bit
more or uncover the muscle

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:22.085
that you already have as you
get stronger, you feel better.

00:01:22.085 --> 00:01:24.210
A little bit of muscle and
a little bit of strength

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:26.008
goes a long way as we age.

00:01:28.376 --> 00:01:29.977
When we talk about
eating with intent,

00:01:29.977 --> 00:01:33.940
what I want you to realize is
when we eat, it has a purpose.

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:36.150
Research shows if I
chop up broccoli and let

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:38.797
it sit for about 90 minutes,
it unlocks the compound

00:01:38.797 --> 00:01:41.130
in the broccoli that could
help control your blood sugar

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:44.015
and has anticancer properties.

00:01:44.015 --> 00:01:45.390
All right, I would
say good luck,

00:01:45.390 --> 00:01:46.980
but you don't need luck
because you're already here.

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:48.750
You'll just show up
and put in the work.

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:50.918
Let go of your concept
of trying to be perfect.

00:01:50.918 --> 00:01:51.960
You may be normal weight.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:52.800
You may be overweight.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:53.758
You may be underweight.

00:01:53.758 --> 00:01:54.593
It doesn't matter.

00:01:54.593 --> 00:01:55.260
You have a body.

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:55.810
You're alive.

00:01:55.810 --> 00:01:56.730
Thank yourself.

00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:59.560
At the end of the day,
you just need you.

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:02.610
I'm Joe Holder, and
this is my MasterClass.

